size 100 8
start
lock hold
keys :
type do 1
keys <CR>
frame busy-frame
file todo.txt busy-file
lock release
keys <CR>
frame ok-frame
file todo.txt ok-file
-- config.toml --
show_sidebar = false
show_detail = false
lock_timeout = "50ms"
-- todo.txt --
A
B id:b
C
D
E
-- busy-frame --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1   A                                                                                           │
│  1   B id:b                                                                                      │
│  2   C                                                                                           │
│  3   D                                                                                           │
│  4   E                                                                                           │
todo.txt is busy (locked by another writer) — nothing changed, try again
 COMMAND  :do 1  <CR> run  <Tab> next  <Esc> cancel
-- busy-file --
A
B id:b
C
D
E
-- ok-frame --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1 ✓ A                                                                                done today │
│  2   B id:b                                                                                      │
│  1   C                                                                                           │
│  2   D                                                                                           │
│  3   E                                                                                           │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  1 done: A  x done  t state  o new  a append  dd delete  u undo  / search
-- ok-file --
x 2026-09-29 A
B id:b
C
D
E
